Tool: `image_gen.imagegen` (`image_gen__imagegen`).
Output: 1254 x 1254 pixels; RGBA (8 bits/channel).
Mode: image edit; `transparent_background: true`.
Reference paths, in order:
- `../ref/idle-template.png` â€” edit target.
